# Example:
#     Upmix 2-channel audio to 2/2 surround using matrix4.
# Input channel map:
#     0: Left
#     1: Right
# Output channel map:
#     0: Left Front
#     1: Right Front
#     2: Left Surround
#     3: Right Surround

matrix4 signal
:2,3 delay 5m decorrelate -s1 -m -f0.7k -l35m 5 allpass 80 0.6 :
